# NODE_NATIVE_UPDATES_V1 (docs/plans/2026-08-24-node-native-updates.md).
#
# Deliberately minimal: this file exists for ONE reason and must not grow into a
# repo-wide line-ending policy by accident. Everything not named here keeps
# behaving exactly as it did before this file was added (core.autocrlf).
#
# install/recover.cmd is the clinic's manual way back to the previous version —
# a batch file a clinic manager double-clicks when an update went wrong, and
# therefore the one file in this repo that has to work on the worst day. cmd.exe
# reads batch files by seeking through them, and `goto :label` is documented to
# misbehave in LF-only files. This repo is built and bundled on Linux CI, where
# a plain checkout would be LF.
#
# `text eol=crlf` means: normalised to LF inside the repository (so diffs stay
# clean), checked out as CRLF on EVERY platform — including the CI runner that
# tars install/ into a release bundle.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
